  "id": "creamy-cilantro-salad-dressing",
  "name": "Creamy Cilantro Salad Dressing",
  "subtitle": "A tangy, chile-spiked dressing with toasted pumpkin seeds",
  "description": "Blend cilantro, roasted chiles, pumpkin seeds, and Cotija with mayonnaise, vinegar, and seasonings for a creamy salad dressing. Refrigerate before serving.",
